Important:
[list]
[*] Added game difficulty settings;
[*] Fixed sound positioning bug for gaming headphones;
[*] Fixed a rare bug with the character freezing after a jump;
[/list]

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/43038513/3aa33f4c4241a4f338f30e75e15225214f05318b.jpg[/img]

Not important:
[list]
[*] Fixed many minor bugs;
[*] Slightly improved some interface elements;
[/list]

Thank you all for your support and feedback!

